Z||000001||FieroJones||12-31-2001||06:50 PM||||The slave is on the Tranny itself, right on the top towards the front of the car. looks like a Cylinder about 1.5" thick, and about 5-6" long.   The Master Cylinder is up front by the spare.  This is the same for all Fiero's, but the part #'s are diff, and sizes and shapes are different<BR>||||reg||1
